{"team":"SEA","col":"#69BE28","identity":"balanced","funnel":"balanced-D","plays_pg":59.5,"adot":7.5,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>A Balanced Attack</h2><p>There's no bell-cow to bank on \u2014 the lead back sees just <strong>50%</strong> of carries (league ~59%), a committee that caps any one back's ceiling and makes their rushing props matchup- and script-dependent.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>In the passing game the ball funnels to <strong>Jaxon Smith-Njigba</strong> \u2014 <strong>29% of targets</strong> (league ~23%), a genuine alpha share that concentrates the receiving value at the top.</p><p>The WR2 is unusually involved here \u2014 <strong>18%</strong> of targets (league ~15%), meaning there's bankable volume beyond the top receiver.</p><p>They're a heavy under-center team (61% shotgun vs ~68%) \u2014 a pro-style, run-committed structure.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 59% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Their red-zone identity is <strong>run-first</strong> (47% pass), funnelling touchdown equity to <strong>Zach Charbonnet</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 No Obvious Seam</h2><p>They lock down opposing WR1s \u2014 just 48 rec yds/game (vs ~58); fade receiving props there.</p><p><strong>Soft against opposing tight ends</strong> \u2014 42 rec yds/game (vs ~35). A rec-yards target.</p><p>They surrender <strong>106 rushing</strong> and <strong>226 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). No dominant funnel \u2014 read it matchup by matchup.</p><p>A stingy, efficient defense \u2014 just 42% success allowed (vs ~44%); temper expectations for opposing skill players.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs).</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Sam Darnold","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":11,"props":{"Comp":19.55,"Att":30.56,"Pass Yds":231.18,"Pass TD":1.48,"INT":0.67,"Rush Yds":10.24}},{"name":"Drew Lock","slot":"QB2","starter":false,"td":17,"props":{"Comp":1.67,"Att":2.75,"Pass Yds":17.99,"Pass TD":0.09,"INT":0.17,"Rush Yds":9.36}}],"RB":[{"name":"Jadarian Price","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":27,"props":{"Rush Att":8.81,"Rush Yds":37.2,"Tgt":2.08,"Rec":1.63,"Rec Yds":11.55}},{"name":"George Holani","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":14,"props":{"Rush Att":2.26,"Rush Yds":8.25,"Tgt":1.77,"Rec":1.2,"Rec Yds":8.46}},{"name":"Emanuel Wilson","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":20,"props":{"Rush Att":3.96,"Rush Yds":17.57,"Tgt":1.6,"Rec":1.09,"Rec Yds":7.23}},{"name":"Velus Jones Jr.","slot":"RB4","starter":false,"td":13,"props":{"Rush Att":2.27,"Rush Yds":13.34,"Tgt":1.12,"Rec":0.68,"Rec Yds":5.86}}],"WR":[{"name":"Jaxon Smith-Njigba","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":33,"props":{"Tgt":7.55,"Rec":5.46,"Rec Yds":68.25,"Rec TD":0.4}},{"name":"Rashid Shaheed","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":14,"props":{"Tgt":2.75,"Rec":1.75,"Rec Yds":25.17,"Rec TD":0.15}},{"name":"Cooper Kupp","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":28,"props":{"Tgt":5.58,"Rec":3.97,"Rec Yds":48.25,"Rec TD":0.35}},{"name":"Tory Horton","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":20,"props":{"Tgt":2.69,"Rec":1.43,"Rec Yds":17.73,"Rec TD":0.23}}],"TE":[{"name":"AJ Barner","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":21,"props":{"Tgt":3.09,"Rec":2.37,"Rec Yds":22.2,"Rec TD":0.24}},{"name":"Eric Saubert","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":14,"props":{"Tgt":2.75,"Rec":1.64,"Rec Yds":13.6,"Rec TD":0.14}},{"name":"Elijah Arroyo","slot":"TE3","starter":false,"td":9,"props":{"Tgt":2.1,"Rec":1.18,"Rec Yds":12.94,"Rec TD":0.09}}]},"schedule":[{"week":1,"ha":"vs","opp":"NE","opp_col":"#7FA8C9","gid":"2026_01_NE_SEA","spread":"\u22123.5","proj":"24\u201320","win":true},{"week":2,"ha":"@","opp":"ARI","opp_col":"#E64868","gid":"2026_02_